Z||000015||Jaygee79||05-02-2001||03:42 PM||||OK you go into PIP, then click Browse.  Pick out the picture that you want to upload.  Then click Post It.  Then hit CTRL + V.  You should get an address for the image with [img] at the beginning and [/img] at the end, and you get your picture.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/smile2.gif"> <P>------------------<BR>Jaime<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pooheey1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
Z||000016||stsmithgt||05-02-2001||05:53 PM||||There's a longer way to do it. Open your history after clicking the "post it!" to put your pictures in, click on the name of the picture to make the address show up at the bottom.  <BR>High light it, copy it, and then paste it into your message back on the forum. <I>picture--&gt;</I>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Bulb_1.gif">    copy, paste    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sprkplug_e0.gif">   for each picture. <BR>I took the long way instead of learning the easy way.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <I>control-v huh.?  I'll have to try that.</I>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>---------------<BR>Will I ever learn? Ow! that's hot....Ow! that's hot....Ow! that's hot...:0)<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/carpicsig.jpg">   <P><p>[This message has been edited by stsmithgt (edited 05-02-2001).]||||reg||3
