Z||000025||Fiero5||05-03-2001||11:24 PM||||I had Paul McKibbens make me a set of custom SS sail panels and the deck lid decal. He should be in process of making me a windshield decal and a set of center wheel cap stickers all with my SS theme. Next is the SS stripe package that I should have in a few days. Wahoo! Fieros are fun!<P>As for engine mods, my Dad has souped it up similar to what he did to my Fiero5 maroon 87, so it can stay with the V6 GT big boys whenever needed. I took out a nice Mustang GT yesterday at the lights. I bet he still hasn't lived that down.<P>Adding the dual exhaust and dumping the stupid performance drianing muffler helps too...heh, heh, heh.<P>Oh, and you should see the interior now! Even nicer than before!<P>Steve||||reg||10
