Z||000032||Fiero5||05-08-2001||09:27 AM||||Except for one or two who think we are nuts, most of them like to see our little cars. Many will stop and ask questions from time to time or take a moment just to look. One guy stops all the time, especially to see what new additions we may have or what new things we have done to one or two of them.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/86_SS_side_scoops1.jpg"> <P>As for which one to take. Sometimes it depends on if one is down being worked on or needs to stay home for some reason, like waiting to be inspected if we waite to long Heh, heh. Marian and my sone only drive automatics, so that will determin which ones they take at times if they are not taking there regular ones. That leaves me with only the standards to pick from, like Fiero5 which is a 5 speed, or Fiero1 which is a 4 speed or...well, you get the idea.||||reg||7
